OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the headlines are often filled
OL,7,Fwith more serious stories, there are
OL,8,Fstill plenty of positive and happier
OL,9,Fmoments happening across the West
OL,10,FMidlands - and we want to celebrate and
OL,11,Fshare them.
OL,13,FThis week, we have heard how farmers
OL,14,Fcame to the aid of people affected by
OL,15,Fthe massive fire in Stourbridge, about
OL,16,Fhow Trotter the tortoise is recovering
OL,17,Fafter losing a leg, and a new way
OL,18,FRobbie Williams has been immortalised.
OL,20,FHere is a look at some of those news
OL,21,Fstories from across the region:
